   asked for a recovery key Gua never shows anyone. */
"gua_encryption_repair_title" = "Finish setting up this device";
"gua_encryption_repair_message" = "This device can't secure your messages yet. Setting it up takes a moment and you don't need anything to hand.";
"gua_encryption_repair_action" = "Set up";
